# Shredder's Revenge, first mode, aimed at Bot2: Bot2 chooses two cards of their hand (Forest and Mountain) and discards them
# (CR 701.9); Bot2 had already discarded one to the hand size on turn 2. {2}{B} is paid by three Moxen and the pool is left empty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Shredder's Revenge
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Forest
Mountain
Plains
Swamp x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Shredder's Revenge.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Target player discards two cards)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
? Bot1.Mana = 
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Choose(Forest; Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 5
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Shredder's Revenge
